      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "(Partial translation of two strophes)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Behold, ships, behold, ships coming into the port.</li>\n<li>Go and see what merchandise they bring.</li>\n<li>Beautiful girls.</li>\n<li>Go and see what they were sold for.</li>\n<li>For a barrel of straw.</li>\n<li>Ah, captain, you have been paid too much.</li>\n<li>Behold, ships, behold ships, coming into the port.</li>\n<li>Go and see what merchandise they bring.</li>\n<li>Handsome boys, finer than gold.</li>\n<li>Go and see what they were sold for.</li>\n<li>For a barrel of gold and gems.</li>\n<li>Ah, captain, you have been paid too little.</li></ol>\n",
